«
@@ ============================================================
@@ PolyArea — area of a polygon on the WGS-84 ellipsoid, from the spherical
@@ excess on the sphere of the same area, with authalic latitudes.
@@ 
@@ Input : a list of at least three corners, each { φ λ } or { "name" φ λ }.
@@         Plain numbers are degrees. The polygon closes by itself.
@@ Output: the area of the polygon.
@@ Edges are great circles of the authalic sphere rather than geodesics.
@@ Angle mode and angle units setting are restored before returning.
@@ ============================================================

  → pts
  «
    IF pts SIZE 3 < THEN "A polygon needs at least three corners" DOERR END
    'AngleMode' RCL 'SetAngleUnits' RCL
    RAD NoAngleUnits
    Ⓒe12♁GPS →Num Ⓒa♁GPS →Num UVAL Ⓒπ →Num 180 / Ⓒe12♁GPS →Num √
    → amode aunits ee2 axa rdn ecc
    «
      '(1-ee2)*(1/(1-ee2)+ATANH(ecc)/ecc)' EVAL 0
      → qpl ttl
      «
        1 pts SIZE FOR kk
          pts kk GET DUP SIZE 1 - GET IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_° CONVERT UVAL END →Num
          pts kk GET DUP SIZE 0 - GET IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_° CONVERT UVAL END →Num
          pts kk pts SIZE MOD 1 + GET DUP SIZE 1 - GET IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_° CONVERT UVAL END →Num
          pts kk pts SIZE MOD 1 + GET DUP SIZE 0 - GET IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_° CONVERT UVAL END →Num
          → la1 lo1 la2 lo2
          «
            'ASIN((1-ee2)*(SIN(la1*rdn)/(1-ee2*SIN(la1*rdn)²)+ATANH(ecc*SIN(la1*rdn))/ecc)/qpl)' EVAL
            'ASIN((1-ee2)*(SIN(la2*rdn)/(1-ee2*SIN(la2*rdn)²)+ATANH(ecc*SIN(la2*rdn))/ecc)/qpl)' EVAL
            lo2 lo1 - 180 + 360 MOD 180 - rdn *
            → bt1 bt2 dlm
            «
              'ttl+2*((TAN(dlm/2)*(TAN(bt1/2)+TAN(bt2/2)))∠(1+TAN(bt1/2)*TAN(bt2/2)))' EVAL 'ttl' STO
            »
          »
        NEXT
        'ABS(ttl)*axa²*qpl/2' EVAL 1_m^2 *
      »
      amode EVAL IF aunits THEN SetAngleUnits ELSE NoAngleUnits END
    »
  »
»
